  "history_of_present_illness": "The patient is a 60\u2011year\u2011old male with a lifelong history of type 2 diabetes diagnosed in 1947. Over decades he has progressed through CKD stages 2, 3 and now stage 4, with documented proteinuria, microalbuminuria, diabetic retinopathy, and anemia. He also has osteoporosis, hypertriglyceridemia, metabolic syndrome, and prostate carcinoma in situ. He is listed as awaiting kidney transplantation. Psychosocial stressors\u2014including social isolation, limited contact, intimate\u2011partner abuse, and chronic stress\u2014are active. Current therapy is limited to insulin for diabetes and an acetaminophen/oxycodone combination for pain, with no antihypertensive, lipid\u2011lowering, or bone\u2011protective agents documented.",
